In my last game, I was in hell, working my way up while looking
for the amulet.  Dungeon level 38.  I found a nurse and decided
to build up my HP a bit.  After gaining a few hit points and
following the nurse around after she teleported a couple of times,
things got a little strange.  The nurse seemed to be asleep: not
moving, not responding to #chat, etc.  Finally, I applied my
stethescope. Instead of giving the message "Status of the nurse: ..."
I got "Status of the XXXXX: ..." where XXXXX was a bunch of graphics
characters (this is on a PC, ASCII codes above 127).

So, I hit the nurse.

"Suddenly, the dungeon collapses! -more-
 You die..."

followed by the sickening sound of my hard drive erasing lots of
level files :-(

There was a message: something like "monster not in mon list".
How did the nurse's name get mutilated?  Cosmic rays??  Or is
this a bug in nethack?

Can someone tell me the circumstances under which the dungeon
collapses?  Is it true that it can be caused by lack of disk
space?

p.s. I got the big level for the first time in this game!

